  m_text: '<color=#FFD27A>CONTROLS</color>

    WASD / Arrows / left stick    steer

    Space / A    dash (brief invincibility)

    Esc / Start    pause

    P / Select    photo mode


    <color=#FFD27A>THE GOAL</color>

